    "tone_preferences": [
      "respectful",
      "thoughtful",
      "measured",
      "professional but human"
    ],
    "description": "Assess tweets for portfolio and public-profile fit using a tiered reputational-risk model. Distinguish clearly between content that should be hidden, content that deserves manual review, and content that is acceptable even if opinionated or dated."
